{"attempt_id": "warmup:WQ-c2d93e1eefdd5533b4a13ef9:QI-17f4f22e9c00648da16f", "content_hash": "e4b5525473fef2b528629ed1ce124f3aa7ddaf47cc267705dd4daeadf93c1e7b", "event_id": "MFI-CAP-8a77d85eeef975bd67e9974f", "event_type": "capture", "evidence": {"first_break": {"kind": "expression", "origin": "user_observed", "text": "抄写题目时将常数 3/2 写成 2/3，若不先核对会改变后续极值与参数边界。"}, "hints_needed": [{"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "指出原题常数是 3/2，并提醒先核对题面。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "提示利用偶函数对称性，把四个不同零点转化为正半轴恰有两个不同零点。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "说明介值定理只能辅助证明存在性，恰好两个零点要由单调性、两端极限和唯一极大值共同保证。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "纠正乘以负数时不等号必须反向，并补充边界等号只产生相切零点。"}], "independent_correct_steps": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "把 a 提出并设置参数比值 k=b/a 的第一步正确。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "正确认识到零点问题可转化为求新函数方程的根。"}], "later_breaks": [{"kind": "method_trigger", "origin": "user_observed", "text": "面对偶函数的四个不同零点，未主动先化为正半轴恰有两个不同零点，并将介值定理误当作主要入口。"}, {"kind": "condition", "origin": "user_observed", "text": "写出驻点 x=1/sqrt(2k) 时未显式检查其存在所需的 k>0。"}, {"kind": "calculation", "origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "解 1-(1/2)ln(2k)>0 时，乘以负数后没有反向不等号，导致最终参数范围方向完全相反。"}], "mastery_score": 2, "mastery_source": "warmup_score", "result": "wrong", "score_basis": {"origin": "source_verified", "text": "主体求导、极值和单调性计算在提示后正确，但最终不等式方向错误导致选项错误，按当前热身评分记 2 分。"}, "self_corrections": [{"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户确认最终错误来自最后一步不等式计算。"}], "unresolved": [], "user_facts": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "能独立提出把 a 提出并令 k=b/a，将问题转化为研究含参数函数的零点。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "最初把题目中的常数 3/2 抄成了 2/3。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "最初只模糊想到介值定理，未主动利用偶函数把四个不同零点转化为正半轴恰有两个不同零点。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "在获得方法方向后，正确求出驻点、递增递减区间、唯一极大值，并正确写出极大值大于零的不等式。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "解最后不等式时方向写反，因而把正确的上界范围误判成下界范围并选择 D。"}]}, "idempotency_key": "8a77d85eeef975bd67e9974ff295775eee26bc3b6b5b36c0040f590615a4ab7c", "initial_state": "pending_nightly", "payload_hash": "5e17abee69d5d04ef58d28d4833d9e31736d32e5807586fb9a0399e4c38f4879", "recorded_at": "2026-08-06T11:22:49+08:00", "requested_action": "record_recurrence", "schema_version": "math-fast-intake-ledger-v1", "score_ref": {"anchor_card_id": "GS-255", "attempt_id": "warmup:WQ-c2d93e1eefdd5533b4a13ef9:QI-17f4f22e9c00648da16f", "event_id": "SCORE-f9384b63c2c77efa70df3d4e", "formal_id": "GS-240", "match_mode": "knowledge_fallback", "queue_id": "WQ-c2d93e1eefdd5533b4a13ef9", "queue_item_id": "QI-17f4f22e9c00648da16f", "score": 2, "source_version": "0d3b0dfe0e1789e7bd329f14589c3ff9b5ca88008f4946133953c7a9fd7d0a8b", "study_date": "2026-08-06"}, "source_bundle": null, "study_date": "2026-08-06", "target": {"formal_id": "GS-240", "identity_state": "verified_score_delivery", "kind": "formal_card", "source_hash_before": "0d3b0dfe0e1789e7bd329f14589c3ff9b5ca88008f4946133953c7a9fd7d0a8b", "source_locator": null}, "thread_ref": null}
